# Project CoAgent Adapters

This folder maps portable CoAgent operating procedures to this project.

Use it for host-specific rules such as:

- project board location;
- packet result paths;
- active visible departments;
- project evidence directories;
- domain-specific stop conditions.

Do not put reusable global skill source here. Put reusable capabilities under
the global CoAgent core:

```text
{{GLOBAL_COAGENT_ROOT}}
```
